          // GUARDED SPOT TWO. As a plain TextWidget this line had no wrapping at all: the gallery of 2026-09-04 measured it 683 x 21 px inside a box of 415 x 83 px and it crossed FacHint by 415 x 33 px. The arithmetic in layout units, at the 1600-high screen where 280 units rendered as 415 px (1.482 px per unit): the string is 683 / 1.482 = 461 units on one line and a line of $font.tiny is 21 / 1.482 = 14.2 units tall. In this 294-unit box 461 / 294 = 1.57, so it wraps to two lines = 28.4 units, and the row is $size.header = 34 -- five units of slack. plain makes it a MultilineTextWidgetClass with wrap 1, and grow false pins size to text v at 0, so a longer translation clips inside the row instead of growing down into the roster band.
          MultilineTextWidgetClass WipeNote {
           visible 1
           ignorepointer 1
           position 176 0
           size 294 34
           hexactpos 1
           vexactpos 1
           hexactsize 1
           vexactsize 1
           color 0.58 0.65 0.71 1
           priority 1
           text "Permadeath: PDAs freeze forever, private chats are left, roles reset to novice. Press twice."
           font "gui/fonts/sdf_MetronBook24"
           "exact text" 1
           "exact text size" 10
           "text halign" left
           "text valign" top
           wrap 1
           "size to text h" 0
           "size to text v" 0
          }
         }
        }
       }
      }
     }
    }
